# What `npm run package` leaves out of wtpool.vsix: everything but the manifest, the README,
# the licence and third-party notices, the bundles, the files the webview loads, the tab icons
# and the Marketplace icon. Source maps and the icon's SVG source stay out. vsce keeps a file
# that any `!` line names, whatever comes after it, so each kept file is named on its own.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!out/extension.js
!out/html.js
!media/webview.js
!media/webview.css
!media/codicon.ttf
!media/icon-light.svg
!media/icon-dark.svg
!media/marketplace-icon.png
